    "description": "Further, if you make only half as much _ironwood_ as the spell would normally allow, any weapon, shield, or suit of armor so created is treated as a magic item with a +1 enhancement bonus.",
    "effect": "An _ironwood_ object weighing up to 5 lb./level",
